This folder contains a set of 66 complexes optimized by OPLS-AA using 
Fletcher-Powell optimization as implemented in BOSS. 
The S66 database have been calculated using CCSD(T), JCTC, 2011, 7, 2427.
Note: Hobza most likely used reported wrong coordinated of 12_water-MeNH2.

All complexes have been optimized without constraints exept the following molecules 
where the angle and dihedral angle were constrained:

30_Benzene-Ethene.z
32_Uracil_Ethyne.z
33_Pyridine-Ethene.z
49_Benzene-Pyridine_TS.z
58_Pyridine-Pyridine_CH-N.z
65_Pyridine_Ethyne.z
66_MeNH2-Pyridine.z

